   "evidence": "ParityOdd.lean:371-377 inlines `\u03b5.eq_smul_basis_det b` and `Module.Basis.det_comp`; Mathlib has no such lemma (grep in upstream/mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Determinant.lean for `compLinearMap.*det` returns only `det_smul` at line 249, and `eq_smul_basis_det` at line 650 is the only ingredient); the general home already exists \u2014 BilinMap.lean:44-79 holds `AlternatingMap.bilinMap` and its general lemmas.",
   "file": "EpsilonEridani/QFT/Scattering/DIS/Tensors/ParityOdd.lean",
   "fix": "Add to `EpsilonEridani/Mathematics/LinearAlgebra/Alternating/BilinMap.lean` the general `theorem AlternatingMap.apply_comp (\u03b5 : M [\u22c0^\u03b9]\u2192\u2097[R] R) (b : Module.Basis \u03b9 R M) (f : M \u2192\u2097[R] M) (v : \u03b9 \u2192 M) : \u03b5 (f \u2218 v) = LinearMap.det f * \u03b5 v` and the `bilinMap` corollary (`f (m i) = m i \u2192 \u03b5.bilinMap m (f v) (f w) = LinearMap.det f * \u03b5.bilinMap m v w`), then derive `parityOddAssumptions_aOfAlt`'s `proper_covariant` field from it in one line.",
   "issue": "The only substantive step of `parityOddAssumptions_aOfAlt` is pure linear algebra \u2014 `\u03b5 = c \u2022 b.det` plus `Basis.det_comp` giving `\u03b5 (f \u2218 v) = det f * \u03b5 v` for a top-degree alternating form \u2014 but it is inlined in a DIS lemma. The same fact is needed again for `Leptonic.lMuNuOdd` (Tensors/Basic.lean:275 has alternation and annihilation lemmas but no covariance lemma) and for roadmap 0.3's `LeviCivita` instantiation, so each will re-prove it.",
   "line": "371"
  }
 ],
